<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Wizhelp (200)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>wizhelp                (or wizhelp topics)
wizhelp &lt;command&gt;
wizhelp notes
</pre>
<p>Help for the gods.
</p><p><b>wizhelp</b> alone lists the god commands you can use: those of level 200 
and up, as far as your own level reaches.
</p><p><b>wizhelp &lt;command&gt;</b> shows the help on one of them, as <a cmd='#'>help</a> does for 
players. You can shorten the name.
</p><p><b>wizhelp notes</b> shows the notes the builders wrote for the zone you are 
in, if they wrote any.
</p><p>These pages are kept on the wiki, under Wizhelp/ (wiki.dikumud.com), and 
fetched into the game's files.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Help</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Wiz</a>
</pre>




</div>